translation.en:
October of last year, of the 21st of January of the current year, and of the agreement made orally with the interested parties on that account, a term stands today for the taking down of the purchase contract agreed between the Prince of Hohenlohe-Ingelfingen and the bank director Leixner at Frankfurt an der Oder concerning the estates Kolno and Kamionna in the Poznań district. At this term there appeared

1, on the part of the vendor

a, as his mandatary the councillor of justice Melzer, who legitimated himself by the special power of attorney granted to him for this act and already in actis;

b, the general mandatary of the Prince, the building councillor Glenck, already personally known to the undersigned;

